  "project_description": "This module is an AddOn for the Entity Usage module .\n\n It allows to use the Entity Usage Delete Warning to disable deletion of nodes that are in use tracked by Entity Usage.\n\n This can be enabled on node type base and there is a permission to skip this (so it does not affect admin users).\n\n Remark:\n\nIf Entity Usage module decides to offer this feature on its own someday, this module would be obsolete. That said, maintainer of this module is open to work on integration with Entity Usage if considered useful.",
